      "id": "flusterstorm-storm-counters",
      "title": "Flusterstorm: with storm copies, P2 cannot pay and the instant is countered",
      "clauses": [1, 2],
      "instructions": [
        "Cast Scenario Opt.",
        "When P2 casts Scenario Bolt at you, cast Flusterstorm targeting it; keep the copies' targets."
